==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|it|eo}} {{term|lang=it|ricevere}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɾi.ˈt͡se.vi/|lang=eo}}
* {{hyphenation|ri|'''ce'''|vi|lang=eo}}

===Verb===
{{eo-head}}
# to [[receive]], to [[get]]
#*: ''Ŝi ĉiam '''ricevas''' bonajn notojn.''
#*:: She always gets good grades.
#*: ''Mi '''ricevis''' leteron de mia korespondanto.''
#*:: I received a letter from my penpal.
#*: ''Nudpugan pugfrapadon, la fiaj knabinetoj '''ricevis'''.''
#*:: The naughty little girls got a bare bottom spanking.

